-- Scope: Independent reading and verification of immutable retrieval candidates.
-- Excludes: Proof of visual accuracy, independent human labels, or answer repair.

contract IndependentSourceAssessment {
    verify_candidates: (records: Any) -> Any

    @invariant ReadSourcesWithoutGeneratedAnswers
        -- After query-only judging and selection, assess every surviving query
        -- against its declared positive sources. The assessment sees only the
        -- candidate index, query, positive identifiers, actual source text and
        -- images, and language. Generated answers, evidence, hop summaries and
        -- extracted document artifacts never enter this request.
        -- Record an independently read answer, supporting evidence, uncertainty,
        -- relevance, modality, native quotes and language assessment per index.

    @invariant CompareWithoutReinterpretingSources
        -- Final verification compares the unchanged candidate answer and claimed
        -- evidence against the independent assessment. It receives no raw source
        -- text or images. Material contradictions, omissions, unsupported added
        -- claims and unresolved queries must fail, not trigger answer repair.
        -- Assess precise quantities, dates, units and entity/time alignment;
        -- semantic paraphrases are not rejected merely for different wording.

    @invariant ScopeRecurringInformationNeeds
        -- Generation requires an edition, date or anchored window for recurring
        -- rankings, bills and histories when the requested facts vary by period.
        -- An account/entity name or unanchored duration alone does not fix time.
        -- Use only source-supported scope. If none is available, choose a
        -- supported evergreen need or abstain; never invent or repair a date.
        -- The blind query judge marks retrieval_discriminative false when a
        -- recurring-period query is ambiguous, without inferring its source.
        -- Genuinely evergreen needs do not require artificial temporal anchors.
        -- Apply these distinctions across languages and all query surfaces.

    @invariant PreserveRequestedMeaningAndFocus
        -- Answers and independent readings are concise but complete for the
        -- immutable query, preserving semantic categories and necessary context.
        -- Geographic coverage is not an asset class; neighboring entries need
        -- not be the requested category merely because they share a list/column.
        -- Do not add adjacent facts not needed to resolve the query. Retain all
        -- requested facts, including every member of a genuinely requested list.
        -- Independent readings identify unresolved category ambiguity rather
        -- than copying lists or guessing. Final comparison rejects category
        -- substitutions using existing grounded/support criteria, not new fields.
        -- These principles apply in every source language. Native-renderer and
        -- gate tests prove instruction delivery/isolation and quarantine, not
        -- that a probabilistic model always follows the semantic instructions.

    @invariant LeaveRequestedInformationUnresolved
        -- Generation leaves the requested result unknown across all source
        -- languages and question/instruction/keyword forms. Necessary scope and
        -- input values are not answers to a different unresolved request.
        -- The blind judge marks plausible_information_need false when the query
        -- recognizably supplies its own requested result, without reconstructing
        -- unavailable sources/answers or using outside model knowledge.
        -- Final source-free comparison rejects an answer that only completes
        -- grammar, expands abbreviations, translates or paraphrases a result
        -- already supplied in the query: both answer_not_revealed_by_query and
        -- answer_resolves_query are false even with perfect grounding scores.
        -- Genuine additional explanation/comparison needs remain possible; do
        -- not invent an unstated need or adjacent facts to rescue a candidate.
        -- Keyword form does not exempt natural-language relationships from this
        -- rule. Naming inputs can provide scope; stating their defining relation
        -- can already supply the requested definition, even without algebra.
        -- Generation, blind judging and final comparison share an illustrative
        -- natural-language contrast between those cases. An explicitly requested
        -- new explanation, comparison or reference may remain unresolved; do not
        -- infer that request merely from search-like form. Permitting a query
        -- surface does not establish its semantic acceptability.
        -- Tests prove request delivery and false-criterion quarantine, not
        -- that model decisions always obey the semantic contract.

    @invariant NativeJudgeResponseFormat
        -- The three existing judges request one schema-conforming JSON object
        -- inside one Markdown json code block, with no bare JSON or outside text.
        -- This reinforces the native response recipe without replacing its
        -- schema/parser, weakening rejection gates or adding another stage.
        -- Preserve the existing blind/source-aware/source-free boundaries.

    @invariant FailClosedAndBindEvidence
        -- Historical records remain readable. Export quarantines a candidate
        -- lacking an independent assessment with an explicit stable reason.
        -- Duplicate or out-of-range assessment indexes fail validation. Bind
        -- each assessment to exactly the candidate's declared positive IDs.
        -- Unanswerable, uncertain, irrelevant or wrong-language assessments,
        -- or missing independent answer/support, cannot be rescued by final
        -- positive scores. Source-derived booleans, modality and native quotes
        -- must agree with the final judgement. Never silently relabel records.
        -- Validate the assessment's own quotes against real positive-unit text,
        -- even when the final judge omits or changes them. Generated evidence
        -- never becomes native text or an authoritative source transcription.

    @invariant SharedPipelineAndDurableAudit
        -- Fresh text-only and image-bearing candidates use the same mandatory
        -- reading and comparison stages. No opt-out quality switch exists.
        -- Empty candidate rows skip both stages and invent no assessments.
        -- Preserve all existing query, modality, leakage and export gates.
        -- Portable source records retain independent assessments, unchanged
        -- candidates and final comparisons; provenance identifies this contract.

    @invariant HonestLimitations
        -- Independent reading may still be wrong, and correlated mistakes can
        -- pass comparison. Deterministic tests establish isolation and gate
        -- behavior, not probabilistic model accuracy or retrieval improvement.

    @invariant ExecutableRequestBoundary
        -- Every declared model request, including system/user prompts and
        -- structured response instructions, renders under the host's default
        -- secure template policy. Do not widen permitted operations to make
        -- a prompt run. Information isolation also holds at this rendered
        -- request boundary, not merely in a generic template implementation.
}
